{#
  FILE:         prompts/templates/ticket_triage/user_message.j2
  WHAT IT DOES: The human turn. The ONLY place where per-ticket data enters the prompt.
  RULES:        Every variable passes through | xml_safe, so a ticket containing "</ticket>"
                cannot break out of its data boundary (tests/unit/test_prompt_assets.py checks this).
                Variables must match required_variables in every manifest that uses this file.
#}
<task>
Triage the support ticket below by following <policies> and <output_contract>.
</task>

<ticket>
<customer_tier>{{ customer_tier | xml_safe }}</customer_tier>
<subject>{{ ticket_subject | xml_safe }}</subject>
<body>
{{ ticket_body | xml_safe }}
</body>
</ticket>

Reply with one JSON object that matches <output_schema>.
